す！\n\nありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1T3ouJNw_-BobUJGO61crYX3Tk9DL7R7J", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@KZMPR6QZy6Ffgej/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2695468, "client_id": 3348003, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e23ba1fb/uploads/origins/9c9d8e55-20c3-4ce5-88af-608bab16f4d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98a3d448a86a3b41cfb9187afd7c4c19", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e23ba1fb/uploads/origins/9c9d8e55-20c3-4ce5-88af-608bab16f4d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=98a3d448a86a3b41cfb9187afd7c4c19, https://si.imgix.net/e23ba1fb/uploads/origins/9c9d8e55-20c3-4ce5-88af-608bab16f4d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f637a0072696d47683b53b6dca5007ad 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e23ba1fb/uploads/origins/9c9d8e55-20c3-4ce5-88af-608bab16f4d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffaca5a5ad5eebedb5164c4b0992cde4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e23ba1fb/uploads/origins/9c9d8e55-20c3-4ce5-88af-608bab16f4d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e6f580c326b4f529301500cda7824b63", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e23ba1fb/uploads/origins/9c9d8e55-20c3-4ce5-88af-608bab16f4d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e6f580c326b4f529301500cda7824b63, https://si.imgix.net/e23ba1fb/uploads/origins/9c9d8e55-20c3-4ce5-88af-608bab16f4d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9a518cd1b56c3827d71b365243996a09 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e23ba1fb/uploads/origins/9c9d8e55-20c3-4ce5-88af-608bab16f4d5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=183ef22b538b7e5f564af55fa1f2634a 3x"}, "body": "こんばんは\nもしよかったら私と友達のOCをかいていただけませんか？\n二人はよく似た顔をしてますが、元は赤の他人です。\nですが双子好き親にのよって双子として生きてきました。\nいろいろなユニバースがあり、ドライブにはいろんなバージョンを入れておりました。\n気が向いた方向で描いていただければ幸いです。\n一人ずつでも二人一緒のキャンバスでも大丈夫です。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1tmbGgM5RKil3rQirM7mA4A67kbTEATWR", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@KZMPR6QZy6Ffgej/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2695468, "client_id": 3492251, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9b5dd59b/uploads/origins/91a1acad-0016-4bf1-bacb-a342d02fae43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d9e2f10ff93f4a9a67761edd529809b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9b5dd59b/uploads/origins/91a1acad-0016-4bf1-bacb-a342d02fae43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4d9e2f10ff93f4a9a67761edd529809b, https://si.imgix.net/9b5dd59b/uploads/origins/91a1acad-0016-4bf1-bacb-a342d02fae43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6da7b37d2aa5615f2c599a822a57f66f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9b5dd59b/uploads/origins/91a1acad-0016-4bf1-bacb-a342d02fae43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6dde4862602612e94099d10ccc30e212 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9b5dd59b/uploads/origins/91a1acad-0016-4bf1-bacb-a342d02fae43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c0dbfc8114e834ccc6bec60cd7506714", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9b5dd59b/uploads/origins/91a1acad-0016-4bf1-bacb-a342d02fae43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c0dbfc8114e834ccc6bec60cd7506714, https://si.imgix.net/9b5dd59b/uploads/origins/91a1acad-0016-4bf1-bacb-a342d02fae43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f45dc3deca9931a2b4f5c82e52dc08a8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9b5dd59b/uploads/origins/91a1acad-0016-4bf1-bacb-a342d02fae43?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=57e61048108679d06a5325b944cfa838 3x"}, "body": "鰯様! Nice to meet you!!\n\nI really love your style of art and SD characters! They are adorable!\nI would like to request an artwork for my original characters.\nPlease draw them in JK school uniform! It’s in the reference file.\n\nYou can decide on pose and expressions! \nPlease make them looking happy and lovely💕\n\nI would like you to include the yellow anglerfish in the art! anywhere is fine!\n\nThe blue hair golden eyed girl is an anglerfish (the fish with lamp on their head) who lived under deep sea now  human,but she still have a fish tail.\nThere’s 3 moles on her face, one under left eye and two next to the right side of her mouth.\nHer personality is energetic but also mischievous.\n\nThe black hair green eye girl is a character inspired by myself.\nher personality: menhera, shy, gloomy, pale skin.\nshe have two moles at right side of her mouth, same as the fish girl.\n\n Thank you again for considering my request🫶\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/mobile/folders/1W0b-yrRLosFu8ZGrFCzeHu1PfUegNMzB", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@KZMPR6QZy6Ffgej/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2695468, "client_id": 3211553, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8064a3a6/uploads/origins/20a2d4d8-2e4a-4d96-ad6c-679126107cd6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=496477d0253774bf144d957c2ac58045", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8064a3a6/uploads/o